{"name":"Baby Bunting","hex":"#abcaea","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"baby","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A very young human, particularly from birth to a couple of years old or until walking is fully mastered.\n\nA very young human, even if not yet born.","A very young human, even if not yet born."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Picked when small and immature (as in baby corn, baby potatoes).","Newest (overall, or in some group or state); most inexperienced."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/baby"},{"term":"bunting","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Strips of material used as festive decoration, especially in the colours of the national flag.","A thin cloth of woven wool from which flags are made; it is light enough to spread in a gentle wind but resistant to fraying in a strong wind."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various songbirds of the genus Emberiza, having short bills and brown or gray plumage."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bunting"}],"entries":[{"title":"Baby Bunting","blocks":[{"text":"Baby Bunting Group Limited is an Australian baby products retail chain. Its stores, located across Australia but with a focus on Australia's eastern coast, sell baby and children's clothing and items."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Baby_Bunting%2C_Cannington.jpg/330px-Baby_Bunting%2C_Cannington.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baby_Bunting"},{"title":"Infant","blocks":[{"text":"An infant is a very young human being. Baby is an alternative term for infant. The terms may also be used to refer to juvenile beings of other organisms. A newborn is, in mainstream use, an infant who is only hours, days, or weeks old; while in medical contexts, a newborn or neonate is an infant in the first 28 days after birth."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/comm